<title>USA: Anderson, S.C., won by J.C. Bradford.</title>
<headline>Anderson, S.C., won by J.C. Bradford.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford &amp; Co. said it won $3.800 million of Anderson, S.C., general obligation bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.31 percent.</p>
